Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester01",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "EMPLOYEE"
}

### 2. EMPLOYEE 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester01",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### MANAGER 회원가입 / 로그인
### ──────────────────────────────────────────

### 3. MANAGER 회원가입 (만료 토큰 헤더 포함해도 200 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/signup
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.invalid.token

{
  "username": "manager01",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "MANAGER"
}

### 4. MANAGER 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "manager01",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 모니터링 이벤트 테스트
### ──────────────────────────────────────────

### 5. 이상 상태 보고 (SLEEP)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/event
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "eventType": "SLEEP"
}

### 6. 이상 상태 보고 (AWAY)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/event
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "eventType": "AWAY"
}

### 7. 정상 상태 보고 (NORMAL)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/event
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "eventType": "NORMAL"
}

### 8. 존재하지 않는 직원 ID ← 404 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/event
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

{
  "employeeId": 9999,
  "eventType": "SLEEP"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 초대 코드 플로우
### ──────────────────────────────────────────

### 9. 초대 코드 생성 (MANAGER 호출) ← 200 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/invite-code
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 10. 팀 참가 (EMPLOYEE 호출) ← 200 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/join-team
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

{
  "inviteCode": "{{inviteCode}}"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 팀 조회 API 테스트
### ──────────────────────────────────────────

### 11. 내 팀 조회 (EMPLOYEE 호출) ← 200 기대
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teams/my-team
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 12. 팀 멤버 목록 조회 (MANAGER 호출) ← 200 기대
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teams/2/members
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

