### 18. 코드 재사용 시도 ← 400 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/join-team
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

{
  "inviteCode": "{{inviteCode}}"
}

### 19. 존재하지 않는 코드 입력 ← 400 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/join-team
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

{
  "inviteCode": "WS-FAKE-CODE"
}

